 # 26\. Fail-safe architecture

 Define explicit policies.

 | Component failure | Recommended behavior |
| --- | --- |
| Price feed unavailable | FAIL CLOSED |
| Risk engine unavailable | FAIL CLOSED |
| Exchange status unknown | STOP/RECONCILE |
| Optional analytics unavailable | DEGRADED |
| Model unavailable | NO TRADE |
| Audit system unavailable | likely NO LIVE TRADE |
| Database unavailable | safe halt/recovery |
| WebSocket unavailable | switch to safe recovery mode |

 Don't make "fail open" the universal rule.

