 # 27\. Dependency security

 Use:

```
Dependabot
dependency review
pip-audit / equivalent
npm audit / equivalent
SBOM
container scanning
license review
pinned dependencies where appropriate
```

 GitHub can automate dependency updates, while workflow security should prevent dependency updates from automatically becoming unrestricted production deployments.

 GitHub also recommends securing Actions with least privilege and supports artifact attestations and OIDC for supply-chain/deployment security.  GitHub Docs+1

