 # 47\. Lookahead verification

 This should be a mandatory release gate.

 Take:

```
Dataset A = data through T
Dataset B = same data through T + arbitrary future data
```

 Then:

```
signal_A(T)
==
signal_B(T)
```

 If not:

```
